notable_achievement:
Average ACT Score is 26.6 (30.2 for the top 25% of the class); 

Of the 85 graduating seniors in the Class of 2025, 76% received a total of $13,101,824 in merit based scholarships; 

Since 2010, Grapevine Faith has had 10 National Merit Scholars, 12 National Merit Semi-finalists, 44 National Merit Commended Students, 5 National Hispanic Scholars, and 2 African American Scholars

In TAPPS State academic and speech and debate competitions, Grapevine Faith traditionally lands in the top 1st, 2nd, and/or 3rd place depending on divisions, and placed 3rd in state in 2025 as an overall team; 

Speech and debate students have also competed on the national level. 

In 2024-2025, Grapevine Faith had 32 Academic All State student athletes

